sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant UI as Web界面
    participant User as User
    participant Comment as Comment
    participant Live as Live
    participant DB as 数据库

    U->>UI: 在直播间输入弹幕/评论
    UI->>User: 校验登录态（Token）
    User-->>UI: 已登录
    UI->>Comment: postComment(targetId=liveId, targetType=直播, content)
    Comment->>Live: 校验直播间是否开放互动
    Live-->>Comment: 允许
    Comment->>DB: INSERT comments
    DB-->>Comment: commentId
    Comment-->>UI: true + 最新评论
    UI-->>U: 刷新互动区展示
